    "title": "Orlando golf course becomes model for stormwater reuse - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Katie Johns ,\n1 days ago Attendees at StormCon 2025 explored the historic Dubsdread Golf Course's stormwater improvements including treatment, wetland rehydration and infrastructure expansion. StormCon 2025 attendees had an opportunity to visit Dubsdread Golf Course near the city of Orlando on August 26, 2025, where they learned about improvements made to the oldest public course layout in central Florida. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
